<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunkers steady, dull ahead of New Year.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunkers steady, dull ahead of New Year.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore bunker indications held steady but were notional on Tuesday in thin talk ahead of the New Year holiday on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>Bunker 180 cst was quoted at $129 and 380-cst at $125 per tonne, unchanged from Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Most shipowners have already left for the day,&quot; a trader said on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>MDO and gas oil were steady at $231-$245 and $255-$262 per tonne respectively.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
